WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.354
Bat flew away.

2
00:00:08.355 --> 00:00:13.135
He did not know how to sing.

3
00:00:13.136 --> 00:00:22.769
He heard Red Bird sing.

4
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:30.597
He tried to sing like Red Bird.

5
00:00:30.598 --> 00:00:34.691
But he was not good at all.

6
00:00:34.692 --> 00:00:38.094
He tried to sing like Cat.

7
00:00:38.095 --> 00:00:42.477
But he was not good at all.

8
00:00:42.478 --> 00:00:45.692
Bat sang and sang.

9
00:00:45.693 --> 00:00:57.847
He tried and tried.

10
00:00:57.848 --> 00:01:06.747
He wanted to sing his wish again.

11
00:01:06.748 --> 00:01:09.878
Cat was still at the well.

12
00:01:09.879 --> 00:01:13.455
But she sang a new song.

13
00:01:13.456 --> 00:01:17.606
"Forget the wish I made before.

14
00:01:17.607 --> 00:01:21.775
This is one that I want more.

15
00:01:21.776 --> 00:01:28.780
Please help Bat sing."

16
00:01:28.781 --> 00:01:33.445
And Bat did sing!

17
00:01:33.446 --> 00:01:36.768
Bat sang to the well.

18
00:01:36.769 --> 00:01:43.504
"Give Cat new things to see."

19
00:01:43.505 --> 00:01:47.938
Then Cat and Bat and Cow went away.

20
00:01:47.939 --> 00:01:53.177
They saw many new things.

21
00:01:53.178 --> 00:01:59.827
And they sang!

